[finding] f-005 In the 7.1-keV mixed cold-plus-warm resonant-production calculation, models retaining at least 60 Milky-Way satellite subhalos include nearly 100% sterile DM wi
**Finding:** In the 7.1-keV mixed cold-plus-warm resonant-production calculation, models retaining at least 60 Milky-Way satellite subhalos include nearly 100% sterile DM with astrophysical mixing sin^2(2θastro) about 7×10^-10; viable models have sin^2(2θastro) less than roughly 10^-9. Here f is the sterile fraction and sin^2(2θastro)=f sin^2(2θtot), so X-ray-inferred mixing differs from microscopic mixing when f<1.
