**Finding:** The directly relevant 2024 minimal-model analysis arXiv:2410.07343 (Chen and Zhang, BBN Constraint on Heavy Neutrino Production and Decay) parameterizes heavy-neutrino cosmology solely by mass m4 and flavor-specific mixing |U_a4|^2 for a=e, μ, τ; it computes the full BBN-excluded space including temporary matter domination and injection of charged mesons, photons, and light neutrinos, and presents BBN as complementary to terrestrial HNL searches.
