**Finding:** The 2024 paper arXiv:2410.06970 finds a nonminimal HNL-plus-axion-like-particle decay scenario with a new cosmologically consistent region approximately 1 MeV–1 GeV in HNL mass and active-sterile mixing strength approximately 10^-9–10^-6; the HNL decays primarily to ALP plus neutrino early enough to relax ordinary BBN limits, while later ALP decay remains subject to cosmological and astrophysical constraints.
