Issues: The evidence ledger is not sufficient for the requested quantitative answer: most quoted excerpts are metadata or truncated abstracts, while the claims depend on numerical regions and plotted contours. Full-text passages, figure captions, and source assumptions must be quoted before treating these findings as established.; The synthesis mixes keV dark-matter production with MeV–GeV late-decaying HNL BBN constraints and with nonminimal production models. The final map must separate mass regime, abundance fraction, production mechanism, lifetime, and whether a point is a published joint constraint or an assembled conditional comparison..
